#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting up a connection with the dialogs"
msgstr "Postavljanje spajanja sa dijalozima"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Setting up a connection with the dialog based setup is not too much more "
"difficult than using the wizard."
msgstr ""
"Postavljanje spajanja sa dijalogom baziranim uređenjem nije više teže nego "
"pomoću čarobnjaka."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can reach the setup dialog the same way you did the wizard. Start &kppp; "
"from your <guimenu>K</guimenu> menu, where you will find its entry in the "
"<guisubmenu>Internet</guisubmenu> as <guimenuitem>Internet Dialer</"
"guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Možete doći do dijaloga uređenja na isti način kao i za čarobnjaka. "
"Pokrenite &kppp; sa svog <guimenu>K</guimenu> menija, gdje ćete pronaći "
"njegov ulaz u <guisubmenu>Internet</guisubmenu> kao <guimenuitem>Internet "
"Pozivanje</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "The following dialog will appear:"
msgstr "Sljedeći dijalog će se pojaviti:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: dialog-setup.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The &kppp; dialer startup screen</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kppp; Početni ekran pozivanja</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: dialog-setup.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The &kppp; dialer startup screen</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase> &kppp; Početni ekran pozivanja</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The &kppp; dialer startup screen</para>"
msgstr "<para>&kppp; Početni ekran pozivanja</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It will probably not have any entries to begin with, and that's what we're "
"about to do now."
msgstr ""
"Vjerovatno neće imati nikakve unose sa kojim ćete početi, i to je nešto na "
"čemu ćemo sada raditi."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guibutton>Configure</guibutton> button to open the "
"<guilabel>&kppp; Configuration</guilabel> dialog. On the <guilabel>Accounts</"
"guilabel> tab select <guilabel>New...</guilabel> to begin setting up a new "
"Internet connection."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite <guibutton>Konfiguriranje</guibutton> da otvorite <guilabel>&kppp; "
"Konfiguracijski</guilabel> dijalog. Na kartici <guilabel>Računi</guilabel> "
"odaberite <guilabel>Novo...</guilabel> da započnete postavljanje nove "
"Internet konekcije."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This time, choose <guilabel>Manual Setup</guilabel> and you'll see the "
"following Dialog appear:"
msgstr ""
"Ovaj put, izaberite <guilabel>Ručno Uređenje</guilabel> i vidjet ćete "
"sljedeći dijalog:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: dialog-setup.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The <guilabel>New Account</guilabel> Dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo> <guilabel>Novi Račun</guilabel> Dijalog</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: dialog-setup.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The <guilabel>New Account</guilabel> Dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase> <guilabel>Novi Račun</guilabel> Dijalog</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The <guilabel>New Account</guilabel> Dialog</para>"
msgstr "<para> <guilabel>Novi Račun</guilabel> Dijalog</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>New Account</guilabel> dialog contains the following sections:"
msgstr "<guilabel>Novi Račun</guilabel> dijalog sadrži sljedeće sekcije:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dial"
msgstr "Pozivaj"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>IP</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>IP</guilabel>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gateway"
msgstr "Prolaz"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>DNS</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>DNS</guilabel>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "Login Script"
msgstr "Skripta prijave"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Execute"
msgstr "Izvrši naredbu"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accounting"
msgstr "Nalog"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You normally won't need to fill in all these, although each of them is "
"described in the following sections."
msgstr ""
"Vi obično ne morate popuniti sve ovo, iako je sve opisano u narednim "
"sekcijama."

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Dial tab"
msgstr "Tabulator Pozivanja"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: dialog-setup.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Accounts <guilabel>Dial</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Računi <guilabel>Pozivaj</guilabel> tabulator</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: dialog-setup.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Accounts <guilabel>Dial</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Računi <guilabel>Pozivaj</guilabel> tabulator</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Accounts <guilabel>Dial</guilabel> tab</para>"
msgstr "<para>Računi <guilabel>Pozivaj</guilabel> tabulator</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Dial</guilabel> tab has the following options:"
msgstr "<guilabel>Pozivaj</guilabel> tabulator ima sljedeće opcije:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Connection Name:"
msgstr "Ime konekcije:"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You must give the account a name. This can be anything you like, but if you "
"have more than one account, each name must be unique."
msgstr ""
"Morate dati računu ime. To može biti bilo šta želite, ali ako imate više od "
"jednog računa, svako ime mora biti jedinstveno."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "Phone Number:"
msgstr "Broj Telefona:"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specify the phone number to dial. You can use characters such as <quote>-</"
"quote> to make the number more legible. If you concatenate a series of "
"numbers separated by a colon (&eg; <userinput>1111111:2222222:3333333</"
"userinput>), &kppp; will try these numbers one after the other whenever it "
"receives a busy signal. You can use the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> button to "
"add another number, <guibutton>Remove</guibutton> to remove a number from "
"the list, and the <guiicon>up</guiicon> and <guiicon>down</guiicon> arrows "
"to change the order of the list."
msgstr ""
"Odredite broj telefona za pozivanje. Možete koristiti znakove kao što su "
"<quote>-</quote> da bi broj bio čitljiviji. Ako povežete u obliku lanca niz "
"brojeva odvojenih dvotačkom (&eg; <userinput>1111111:2222222:3333333</"
"userinput>), &kppp; će pokušati ove brojeve, jedan za drugim kad god primi "
"signal zauzeća. Možete koristiti <guibutton>Dodaj</guibutton> dugme da "
"dodate drugi broj, <guibutton>Ukloni</guibutton> da uklonite broj iz liste, "
"i <guiicon>gore</guiicon> i <guiicon>dolje</guiicon> strelice za promjenu "
"redoslijeda liste."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Ovjera"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the appropriate method of authentication that &kppp; should use to "
"log into the server. Check with your provider for more information. Use of "
"<acronym>PAP</acronym> and <acronym>CHAP</acronym> are described in the "
"chapter <xref linkend=\"chap-and-pap\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite odgovarajući način ovjere koje &kppp; treba koristiti da biste se "
"prijavili na server. Provjerite sa svojim pružateljem usluga za više "
"informacija. Upotreba <acronym>PAP</acronym> i <acronym>CHAP</acronym> su "
"opisane u poglavlju <xref linkend=\"chap-and-pap\"/>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "Store password"
msgstr "Spremi lozinku"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want &kppp; to remember your password between "
"sessions."
msgstr ""
"Potvrdi ovu opciju ako želite da &kppp; zapamti vašu lozinku između sesija."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: dialog-setup.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customize pppd arguments..."
msgstr "Prilagodite pppd argumente..."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will bring up the <application>pppd</application> arguments dialog. You "
"can use this dialog to add any desired options that you want &kppp; to hand "
"to <application>pppd</application>. See the <application>pppd</application> "
"man page for a list of available options, but unless you know exactly what "
"you are doing, you should probably restrain yourself from tinkering with "
"these."
msgstr ""
"Ovo će podići <application>pppd</application> dijalog argumenata. Možete "
"koristiti ovaj dijalog da dodate bilo koju željenu opciju koje želite da "
"&kppp; preda <application>pppd</application>. Pogledajte <application>pppd</"
"application> man stranicu za popis dostupnih opcija, ali osim ako ne znate "
"tačno što radite, trebalo bi da se suzdržite od petljanja s ovim."

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid "The IP tab"
msgstr "IP tabular"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: dialog-setup.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Accounts <guilabel>IP</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Računi <guilabel>IP</guilabel> tabular</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: dialog-setup.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Accounts <guilabel>IP</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Računi <guilabel>IP</guilabel> tabular</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Accounts <guilabel>IP</guilabel> tab</para>"
msgstr "<para>Računi <guilabel>IP</guilabel> tabular</para>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dynamic IP Address"
msgstr "Dinamička IP Adresa"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this if your <acronym>ISP</acronym> uses dynamic <acronym>IP</acronym> "
"address assignment. In this case, your <acronym>IP</acronym> address will "
"change every time you establish a connection."
msgstr ""
"Potvrdite ovo ako vaš <acronym>ISP</acronym> koristi dinamički <acronym>IP</"
"acronym> zadatu adresu. U ovom slučaju, vaša <acronym>IP</acronym> adresa će "
"se promijeniti svaki put kad uspostavite vezu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "Static IP Address"
msgstr "Statička IP Adresa"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this if your <acronym>ISP</acronym> has given you a static "
"<acronym>IP</acronym> address. In that case you will also need to fill in "
"that address in the <guilabel>IP Address</guilabel> box, and any "
"<guilabel>Subnet Mask</guilabel> if applicable. Ask your <acronym>ISP</"
"acronym> if unsure. Dynamically assigned addresses are used in the huge "
"majority if <acronym>ISP</acronym>'s and leaving this checked will in most "
"cases be the right choice."
msgstr ""
"Potvrdite ovo ako vaš <acronym>ISP</acronym> vam daje statičku <acronym>IP</"
"acronym> adresu. U tom slučaju ćete također morati popuniti i tu adresu u "
"<guilabel>IP Adresa</guilabel> okviru, i bilo koju <guilabel>Subnet Masku</"
"guilabel> ako je primjenjivo. Pitajte vaš <acronym>ISP</acronym> ako niste "
"sigurni. Dinamički dodijeljene adrese se koriste uglavnom kod <acronym>ISP</"
"acronym> 'va i ostavljanjem ovog potvrdnim u većini slučajeva će biti pravi "
"izbor."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto-configure hostname from this IP"
msgstr "Auto-kofiguriši ime domaćina sa ovog IP"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want &kppp; to set the hostname and domain for "
"your machine after a successful <acronym>ppp</acronym> connection."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite ovu opciju ako želite da &kppp; postavi ime domaćina i domenu za "
"vaš uređaj nakon uspješnog <acronym>PPP</acronym> spajanja."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is done by querying the defined Domain Name Server with the "
"<acronym>IP</acronym> assigned for the <acronym>ppp</acronym> link."
msgstr ""
"Ovo se radi upitima o definiranim Imenima Domena Servera sa <acronym>IP</"
"acronym> dodijeljenim za <acronym>PPP</acronym> link."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option is useful for those stand-alone machines which want to use "
"protocols such as talk, which require the hostname to be the same as your "
"machine is known on the internet. It overrides the <guilabel>Domain Name</"
"guilabel> option in the <guilabel>DNS</guilabel> section, and the machine "
"defaults are restored to their original values when you close the "
"<acronym>ppp</acronym> connection."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija je korisna za one samostalne mašine koje žele da koristite "
"protokole kao što je razgovor, koji zahtijevaju da ime domaćina bude isto "
"kao vašeg uređaja na internetu. To nadjačava <guilabel>Ime Domene</guilabel> "
"opciju u sekciji <guilabel>DNS</guilabel>, a mašinine zadane vrijednosti se "
"vraćaju na prvobitne vrijednosti kada zatvorite <acronym>ppp</acronym> vezu."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option is <emphasis>not</emphasis> useful if you just want to connect "
"to the internet and surf, check mail, or chat. It has the side-effect of "
"disallowing any new connections to your X server - in other words, you can't "
"open any more <acronym>GUI</acronym> programs."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija je <emphasis>ne</emphasis> korisna ako se samo želite povezati na "
"internet i surfati, provjeriti mail ili chatati. Ona ima sporedni efekat "
"odbijanja bilo kakve nove veze na vaš X server - drugim riječima, ne možete "
"otvoriti više <application>GUI</application> programa."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid "Only turn this on if you are absolutely sure you need it."
msgstr "Samo uključite ovo ako ste apsolutno sigurni da je to potrebno."

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Gateway tab"
msgstr "Tabular Prolaza"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: dialog-setup.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Accounts <guilabel>Gateway</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Računi <guilabel>Prolaz</guilabel> tabular</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: dialog-setup.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Accounts <guilabel>Gateway</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Računi <guilabel>Prolaz</guilabel> tabular</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Accounts <guilabel>Gateway</guilabel> tab</para>"
msgstr "<para>Računi <guilabel>Prolaz</guilabel> tabular</para>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid "Default Gateway"
msgstr "Zadani Prolaz"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this if you want <application>pppd</application> to use the default "
"Gateway for your machine. This is the default."
msgstr ""
"Potvrdite ovo ako želite da <application>pppd</application> koristi zadani "
"Prolaz za vaš uređaj. Ovo je zadano."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid "Static Gateway"
msgstr "Statički Prolaz"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this if you want to specify the Gateway to be used in place of the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Potvrdite ovo ako želite da određeni Prolaz bude korišten umjesto zadanog."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid "Assign the Default Route to this Gateway"
msgstr "Dodijeli Zadanu Putanju za ovaj Prolaz"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid "You almost certainly will need this to be checked (the default)."
msgstr "Gotovo sigurno ćete morati da ovo potvrdite (zadano)."

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid "The DNS tab"
msgstr "DNS tabular"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: dialog-setup.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Accounts <guilabel>DNS</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Računi <guilabel>DNS</guilabel> tabular</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: dialog-setup.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Accounts <guilabel>DNS</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Računi <guilabel>DNS</guilabel> tabular</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Accounts <guilabel>DNS</guilabel> tab</para>"
msgstr "<para>Računi <guilabel>DNS</guilabel> tabular</para>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid "Domain Name:"
msgstr "Ime Domene:"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specify the domain name for your machine. As with <acronym>DNS</acronym> "
"addresses, it is restored to the original specified in <filename>/etc/resolv."
"conf</filename> when the connection goes down. If it is left blank, no "
"changes are made to the domain name specified in <filename>/etc/resolv.conf</"
"filename>"
msgstr ""
"Navedite naziv domene za svoj uređaj. Kao i kod <acronym>DNS</acronym> "
"adresa, ona se vrati na originalnu navedenu u <filename>/etc/resolv.conf</"
"filename> kada se veza prekine. Ako je ostalo prazno, nisu napravljene "
"promjene u ime domene navedene u <filename>/etc/resolv.conf</filename>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration:"
msgstr "Podešavanja:"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose between <guilabel>Automatic</guilabel> (the <acronym>ISP</acronym> "
"will automatically issue you <acronym>DNS</acronym> server addresses when "
"you connect) and <guilabel>Manual</guilabel>. If you choose manual, the "
"<guilabel>DNS IP Address</guilabel> section is then enabled."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite između <guilabel>Automatski</guilabel> (<acronym>ISP</acronym> će "
"vam automatski izdati <acronym>DNS</acronym> adrese servera kada se "
"povežete) i <guilabel>Ručno</guilabel>. Ako se odlučite za ručno, sekcija "
"<guilabel>DNS IP Adresa</guilabel> je onda omogućena."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid "DNS IP Address"
msgstr "DNS IP Adresa"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This section is only enabled if you chose <guilabel>Manual</guilabel> in the "
"previous option. Add the Domain Name Servers assigned to you by your "
"<acronym>ISP</acronym>. You must specify at least one Domain Name Server for "
"your <acronym>OS</acronym> to be able to resolve human readable <acronym>IP</"
"acronym> addresses such as <systemitem>ftp.kde.org</systemitem>. The "
"<acronym>DNS</acronym> server addresses supplied must be in numeric form, "
"&eg; <systemitem>128.231.231.233</systemitem>. These addresses will be added "
"at runtime to <filename>/etc/resolv.conf</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Ova sekcija je omogućena samo ako ste odabrali <guilabel>Ručno</guilabel> u "
"prethodnoj opciji. Dodaj Ime Domene Servera dodijeljeno vama od vašeg "
"<acronym>ISP</acronym>. Morate navesti barem jedno Ime Domene Servera za vaš "
"<acronym>OS</acronym> da bi bili u stanju riješiti ljudski čitljive "
"<acronym>IP</acronym> adrese kao što su <systemitem>ftp.kde.org</"
"systemitem>. <acronym>DNS</acronym> adrese servera moraju biti date u "
"numeričkom obliku, &eg; <systemitem>128.231.231.233</systemitem>. Ove adrese "
"će biti dodane u runtime <filename>/etc/resolv.conf</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> button to add each new <acronym>DNS</"
"acronym> server address to the list box below. Choose <guibutton>Remove</"
"guibutton> to remove an entry from the list."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite <guibutton>Dodaj</guibutton> dugme da dodate novu <acronym>DNS</"
"acronym> server adresu na okvir listu ispod. Izaberite <guibutton>Ukloni</"
"guibutton> da uklonite ulaz s liste."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid "Disable existing DNS Servers during Connection"
msgstr "Onemogući postojeće DNS Servere tokom Spajanja"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you check this box, any <acronym>DNS</acronym> servers listed in "
"<filename>/etc/resolv.conf</filename> will be disabled while the connection "
"remains up."
msgstr ""
"Ako označite ovaj okvir, bilo koji <acronym>DNS</acronym> serveri navedeni u "
"<filename>/etc/resolv.conf</filename> će biti onemogućeni dok traje veza."

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Login Script tab"
msgstr "Tabular Prijave Skripte"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: dialog-setup.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>The Accounts <guilabel>Login Script</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""
"<screeninfo>Računi <guilabel>Prijava Skripte</guilabel> tabular</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: dialog-setup.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Accounts <guilabel>Login Script</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Računi <guilabel>Prijava Skripte</guilabel> tabular</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:344
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Accounts <guilabel>Login Script</guilabel> tab</para>"
msgstr "<para>Računi <guilabel>Prijava Skripte</guilabel> tabular</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use this dialog to compose a dial in script for your <acronym>ISP</acronym> "
"dialup connection. You can use the mini-terminal and the information "
"supplied by your <acronym>ISP</acronym> to find out what sequence of actions "
"needs to be executed."
msgstr ""
"Koristite ovaj dijalog da bi sastavili biranje u skripti za vašu "
"<acronym>ISP</acronym> dialup vezu. Možete koristiti mini-terminal i "
"informacije dobijene od vašeg <acronym>ISP</acronym> da bi saznali koji "
"slijed radnji treba izvršiti."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose an option from the drop down box on the left, and then add any "
"parameters for that action in the edit box on the right. Use <guibutton>Add</"
"guibutton> to add each entry to the <emphasis>bottom</emphasis> of the "
"script, which is displayed in the lower part of the dialog. Use "
"<guibutton>Insert</guibutton> to insert an entry anywhere in the script, and "
"use <guibutton>Remove</guibutton> to delete a line from the script."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite opciju iz padajućeg okvira s lijeve strane, a zatim dodajte bilo "
"koje parametre za tu radnju u uređujući okvir na desnoj strani. Koristite "
"<guibutton>Dodaj</guibutton> da dodate svaki ulaz na <emphasis>dno</"
"emphasis> skripte, koja se prikazuje u donjem dijelu dijaloga. Koristite "
"<guibutton>Ubaci</guibutton> da ubacite ulaz bilo gdje u skriptu, i "
"koristite <guibutton>Ukloni</guibutton> da obrišete liniju iz skripte."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "The options available are:"
msgstr "Dostupne opcije su:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:365
#, no-c-format
msgid "Expect"
msgstr "Očekivati"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:367
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kppp; will wait for the specified string to be received."
msgstr "&kppp; će čekati da primi određeni string."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid "Send"
msgstr "Pošaljite"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kppp; will send the specified string."
msgstr "&kppp; će poslati određeni string."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:377
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scan"
msgstr "Skenirati"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:379
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kppp; will scan the input stream for the specified string, and will store "
"any character from the end of the string up to the next newline, in an "
"internal buffer. Trailing and leading whitespace will be stripped off."
msgstr ""
"&kppp; će skenirati ulazni stream za određeni string, i spremiti bilo koji "
"znak od kraja niza do novog reda, u internom bufferu. Tražena i vodeća "
"prazna mjesta će se biti skinuta."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:385
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Spasiti"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Permanently store the previously scanned string in the specified register. "
"Currently the only valid register is <varname>password</varname>."
msgstr ""
"Trajno sačuvajte prethodno skeniran string u navedenom registru. Trenutno je "
"jedini važeći registar <varname>lozinka</varname>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:392
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pause (sec)"
msgstr "Pauza (sec)"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:394
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pause for the specified number of seconds."
msgstr "Pauziraj određeni broj sekundi."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hangup"
msgstr "Prekinuti"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:400
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kppp; will send the <command>hangup</command> to the modem."
msgstr "&kppp; će poslati <command>prekini</command> modemu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:404
#, no-c-format
msgid "Answer"
msgstr "Odgovoriti"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:406
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kppp; will set the modem into answer mode."
msgstr "&kppp; će postaviti modem u mod odgovaranja."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:410
#, no-c-format
msgid "Timeout (sec)"
msgstr "Tajm-aut (sec)"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:412
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Change the default timeout to the specified number of seconds dynamically "
"during the script. You can change the timeout several times during script "
"execution if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Promjeni zadani tajm-aut na određeni broj sekundi dinamički tokom skripte. "
"Možete promijeniti tajm-aut nekoliko puta tokom izvođenja skripte ako je to "
"potrebno."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:418
#, no-c-format
msgid "Prompt"
msgstr "Navesti"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:420
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Prompt the &kppp; user to enter a string, given the specified string as a "
"hint. The user will see what is typed. If the specified string includes the "
"mark <userinput>##</userinput>, the mark will be replaced with the current "
"content of the internal scan buffer, as previously stored with the "
"<guilabel>scan</guilabel> command."
msgstr ""
"Navesti &kppp; korisnika da unese string, dati određeni string kao savjet. "
"Korisnik će vidjeti ono što je uneseno. Ako navedeni string uključuje oznaku "
"<userinput>##</userinput>, znak će biti zamijenjen sa trenutnim sadržajem "
"unutrašnjeg buffera skeniranja, kao što je prethodno pohranjen sa "
"<guilabel>skeniraj</guilabel> komandom."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:428
#, no-c-format
msgid "PWPrompt"
msgstr "PWNavesti"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:430
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Prompt the &kppp; user to enter a string, given the specified string as a "
"hint. An asterisk will be printed for each character the user types."
msgstr ""
"Navesti &kppp; korisnika da unese string, sa navedenim stringom kao "
"savjetom. Jedna zvjezdica će se štampati za svaki znak tipa korisnika."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:435
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>ID</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ID</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:437
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the <guilabel>Login ID</guilabel> field on &kppp;'s main dialog is filled "
"in, send that <acronym>ID</acronym>. If the <guilabel>Login ID</guilabel> "
"field is not filled in, prompt the &kppp; user to enter an <acronym>ID</"
"acronym>, given the specified string as a hint. The user will see what is "
"typed. On a second pass, such as in a loop on a second iteration, or during "
"callback authentication, the prompt will be displayed regardless of whether "
"the <guilabel>Login ID</guilabel> field is filled in."
msgstr ""
"Ako se <guilabel>Prijava ID</guilabel> polje na &kppp;'s glavnom dijalogu "
"popunjava, pošaljite <acronym>ID</acronym>. Ako <guilabel>Prijava ID</"
"guilabel> polje nije ispunjeno, navedi &kppp; korisnika da unese "
"<acronym>ID</acronym>, sa navedenim stringom kao savjetom. Korisnik će "
"vidjeti ono što je uneseno. Na drugom prolazu, kao što je petlja u drugoj "
"iteraciji, ili za vrijeme ovjere povratnog poziva, navođenje će biti "
"prikazano bez obzira da li je <guilabel>Prijava ID</guilabel> polje "
"popunjeno."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Lozinka"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:449
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the <guilabel>Password</guilabel> field on &kppp;'s main dialog is filled "
"in, send that password. If the <guilabel>Password</guilabel> field is not "
"filled in, prompt the &kppp; user to enter a password, with the specified "
"string as a hint. An asterisk will be printed for each character typed. On a "
"second pass, such as in a loop on a second iteration, or during callback "
"authentication, the prompt will be displayed regardless of whether the "
"<guilabel>Password</guilabel> field is filled in."
msgstr ""
"Ako se <guilabel>Lozinka</guilabel> polje na &kppp; 's glavnom dijalogu "
"popunjava, pošaljite tu lozinku. Ako <guilabel>Lozinka</guilabel> polje nije "
"ispunjeno, navedite &kppp; korisnika da unese lozinku, sa navedenim stringom "
"kao savjetom. Jedna zvjezdica će se štampati za svaki tip znaka. Na drugom "
"prolazu, kao što je petlja u drugoj iteraciji, ili za vrijeme ovjere "
"povratnog poziva, navođenje će biti prikazano bez obzira da li je "
"<guilabel>Lozinka</guilabel> polje popunjeno."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:459
#, no-c-format
msgid "LoopStart"
msgstr "PočetakPetlje"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:461
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kppp; will wait for the specified string to be received. It will save the "
"string for use by <varname>LoopEnd</varname>."
msgstr ""
"&kppp; će čekati da primi određeni string. To će spasiti string za "
"korištenje od strane <varname>KrajaPetlje</varname>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:466
#, no-c-format
msgid "LoopEnd"
msgstr "KrajPetlje"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:468
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kppp; will wait for the specified string to be received to exit the loop. "
"If the string given by the corresponding <varname>LoopStart</varname> is "
"received first, it will trigger a jump to the line after <varname>LoopStart</"
"varname>, enabling repetition of username/password style paired dialogs."
msgstr ""
"&kppp; će čekati da primi određeni string za izlazak iz petlje. Ako string "
"dat od odgovarajućeg <varname>PočetkaPetlje</varname> se primi prvi, to će "
"izazvati skok na liniju nakon <varname>PočetkaPetlje</varname>, "
"omogućavajući ponavljanje korisničkog imena/lozinke stila uparenih dijaloga."

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:478
#, no-c-format
msgid "Example Scripts"
msgstr "Primjer Skripte"

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid "A simple example login script"
msgstr "Jednostavni primjer skripte prijave"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:482
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here is a simple example script I could use to connect to my <acronym>ISP</"
"acronym>"
msgstr ""
"Evo jednostavnog primjera skripte koji bih mogao koristiti za spajanje sa "
"<acronym>ISP</acronym>"

#. Tag: screen
#: dialog-setup.docbook:485
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Expect      ID:                        <lineannotation># wait for ID:</"
"lineannotation>\n"
" Send        myid                       <lineannotation># you have to "
"substitute myid with your id</lineannotation>\n"
" Expect      word:                      <lineannotation># wait for "
"'password'</lineannotation>\n"
" Send        4u3fjkl                    <lineannotation># send my password "
"'4u3fjkl'</lineannotation>\n"
" Expect      granted                    <lineannotation># My ISP send "
"'Permission granted' on login success.</lineannotation>\n"
" Send        ppp                        <lineannotation># This starts a ppp "
"connection for \n"
"                                        # me on the ISP side.</"
"lineannotation>"
msgstr ""
"Expect      ID:                        <lineannotation># wait for ID:</"
"lineannotation>\n"
" Send        myid                       <lineannotation># you have to "
"substitute myid with your id</lineannotation>\n"
" Expect      word:                      <lineannotation># wait for "
"'password'</lineannotation>\n"
" Send        4u3fjkl                    <lineannotation># send my password "
"'4u3fjkl'</lineannotation>\n"
" Expect      granted                    <lineannotation># My ISP send "
"'Permission granted' on login success.</lineannotation>\n"
" Send        ppp                        <lineannotation># This starts a ppp "
"connection for \n"
"                                        # me on the ISP side.</"
"lineannotation>"

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:490
#, no-c-format
msgid "A login script that prompts for ID and password, and has loops."
msgstr "Skripta prijave koja navodi ID i lozinku, i ima petlje."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:492
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here is a script for the same account with an <acronym>ID</acronym> and "
"password prompt. This script will prompt for <acronym>ID</acronym> and "
"password each time, no matter what is typed into the <guilabel>Login ID</"
"guilabel> and <guilabel>password</guilabel> fields on &kppp;'s main screen."
msgstr ""
"Evo skripte za isti račun sa <acronym>ID</acronym> i navođenjem lozinke. Ova "
"skripta će navesti <acronym>ID</acronym> lozinku svaki put, bez obzira šta "
"je ukucano u <guilabel>Prijava ID</guilabel> i <guilabel>lozinka</guilabel> "
"polja na &kppp; 'om glavnom ekranu."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:497
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This script also illustrates the use of the LoopStart/LoopEnd structure. If "
"something goes wrong during the login procedure, for example, I mistype the "
"password, my <acronym>ISP</acronym> will print an error message and restart "
"the id/password loop by issuing the string <computeroutput>ID:</"
"computeroutput> again. If the string <computeroutput>ID:</computeroutput> is "
"caught before the LoopEnd keyword was parsed, &kppp; will start the script "
"again, from the line after the LoopStart keyword."
msgstr ""
"Ova skripta također prikazuje upotrebu PočetkaPetlje/KrajaPetlje strukture. "
"Ako nešto krene po zlu za vrijeme postupka prijave, na primjer, unesete "
"pogrešnu lozinku, moj <acronym>ISP</acronym> će ispisati poruku o grešci i "
"ponovo pokrenuti id/lozinka petlju izdavanjem stringa <computeroutput>ID:</"
"computeroutput >. Ako string <computeroutput>ID:</computeroutput> je uhvaćen "
"prije nego što je raščlanio ključnu riječ KrajPetlje, &kppp; će iznova "
"pokrenuti skriptu, od linije nakon ključne riječi PočetakPetlje."

#. Tag: screen
#: dialog-setup.docbook:505
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"LoopStart   ID:                        <lineannotation># wait for ID:</"
"lineannotation>\n"
" Prompt      Enter ID:                  <lineannotation># Prompt me for my "
"ID and send it off.</lineannotation>\n"
" Expect      word:                      <lineannotation># wait for "
"'password'</lineannotation>\n"
" PWPrompt    Enter Password:            <lineannotation># Prompt me for my "
"password and send it off.</lineannotation>\n"
" LoopEnd     granted                    <lineannotation># My ISP send "
"'Permission granted' on login success.</lineannotation>\n"
" Send        ppp                        <lineannotation># This starts a ppp "
"connection for me</lineannotation>"
msgstr ""
"LoopStart   ID:                        <lineannotation># wait for ID:</"
"lineannotation>\n"
" Prompt      Enter ID:                  <lineannotation># Prompt me for my "
"ID and send it off.</lineannotation>\n"
" Expect      word:                      <lineannotation># wait for "
"'password'</lineannotation>\n"
" PWPrompt    Enter Password:            <lineannotation># Prompt me for my "
"password and send it off.</lineannotation>\n"
" LoopEnd     granted                    <lineannotation># My ISP send "
"'Permission granted' on login success.</lineannotation>\n"
" Send        ppp                        <lineannotation># This starts a ppp "
"connection for me</lineannotation>"

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:509
#, no-c-format
msgid "Prompts for information not filled in on the main dialog."
msgstr "Navodi na informaciju nepopunjenu u glavnom dijalogu."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:511
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here is the script that I actually use to connect to my <acronym>ISP</"
"acronym>. This script will prompt for <acronym>ID</acronym> and password "
"only if I haven't filled in the respective fields on &kppp;'s main dialog."
msgstr ""
"Evo skripte koju sam zapravo koristio za spajanje sa <acronym>ISP</acronym>. "
"Ova skripta će navesti <acronym>ID</acronym> i lozinku samo ako nisam "
"ispunio odgovarajuća polja na &kppp;'om glavnom dijalogu."

#. Tag: screen
#: dialog-setup.docbook:516
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"LoopStart   ID:                        <lineannotation># wait for ID:</"
"lineannotation>\n"
" ID          Enter ID:                  <lineannotation># Prompt me for my "
"ID and send it off.</lineannotation>\n"
" Expect      word:                      <lineannotation># wait for "
"'password'</lineannotation>\n"
" Password    Enter Password             <lineannotation># Prompt me for my "
"password and send it off.</lineannotation>\n"
" LoopEnd     granted                    <lineannotation># My ISP send "
"'Permission granted' on login success.</lineannotation>\n"
" Send        ppp                        <lineannotation># This starts a ppp "
"connection for me</lineannotation>\n"
"                                        <lineannotation># on the ISP side</"
"lineannotation>"
msgstr ""
"LoopStart   ID:                        <lineannotation># wait for ID:</"
"lineannotation>\n"
" ID          Enter ID:                  <lineannotation># Prompt me for my "
"ID and send it off.</lineannotation>\n"
" Expect      word:                      <lineannotation># wait for "
"'password'</lineannotation>\n"
" Password    Enter Password             <lineannotation># Prompt me for my "
"password and send it off.</lineannotation>\n"
" LoopEnd     granted                    <lineannotation># My ISP send "
"'Permission granted' on login success.</lineannotation>\n"
" Send        ppp                        <lineannotation># This starts a ppp "
"connection for me</lineannotation>\n"
"                                        <lineannotation># on the ISP side</"
"lineannotation>"

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:521
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A script for an <acronym>ISP</acronym> using challenge/response "
"authentication."
msgstr "Skripta za <acronym>ISP</acronym> koristi izazov/odgovor ovjeru."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:524
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here is a script that I use to connect to an <acronym>ISP</acronym> which is "
"using some sort of challenge/response authentication. Usually you got a "
"hardware token (a smart card with a display and calculator like keypad) from "
"the <acronym>ISP</acronym>. You have to know a password to use the token. "
"After dialing in your <acronym>ISP</acronym> displays your challenge. You "
"have to type in the challenge to your token and get a dynamic password as a "
"response. Then you have to enter that password."
msgstr ""
"Evo skripte koju koristim za povezivanje sa <acronym>ISP</acronym> koji "
"koristi neku vrstu izazov/odgovor ovjere. Obično imate hardverski znak "
"(pametne kartice s ekranom i digitronom nalik na tastaturu) iz <acronym>ISP</"
"acronym>. Morate znati lozinku za korištenje znaka. Nakon pozivanja u vaš "
"<acronym>ISP</acronym> prikazuje se vaš izazov. Morate ukucati izazov za vaš "
"znak i dobiti dinamičnu lozinku kao odgovor. Zatim morate unijeti tu lozinku."

#. Tag: screen
#: dialog-setup.docbook:532
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"LoopStart   ID:                        <lineannotation># wait for ID:</"
"lineannotation>\n"
" ID          Enter ID:                  <lineannotation># Prompt me for my "
"ID and send it off.</lineannotation>\n"
" Scan        Challenge:                 <lineannotation># Scan for "
"'Challenge' and store everything behind up to the next newline.</"
"lineannotation>\n"
" Expect      Password:                  <lineannotation># wait for "
"'password'</lineannotation>\n"
" Prompt      Your token is ## - Enter Password  # Prompt me for my password "
"and send it off.\n"
" LoopEnd     granted                    <lineannotation># My ISP sends "
"'Permission granted' on login success.</lineannotation>\n"
" Send        ppp                        <lineannotation># This starts a ppp "
"connection for me\n"
"                                        # on the ISP side</lineannotation>"
msgstr ""
"LoopStart   ID:                        <lineannotation># wait for ID:</"
"lineannotation>\n"
" ID          Enter ID:                  <lineannotation># Prompt me for my "
"ID and send it off.</lineannotation>\n"
" Scan        Challenge:                 <lineannotation># Scan for "
"'Challenge' and store everything behind up to the next newline.</"
"lineannotation>\n"
" Expect      Password:                  <lineannotation># wait for "
"'password'</lineannotation>\n"
" Prompt      Your token is ## - Enter Password  # Prompt me for my password "
"and send it off.\n"
" LoopEnd     granted                    <lineannotation># My ISP sends "
"'Permission granted' on login success.</lineannotation>\n"
" Send        ppp                        <lineannotation># This starts a ppp "
"connection for me\n"
"                                        # on the ISP side</lineannotation>"

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:536
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using Scan and Save in scripts"
msgstr "Korištenje Skeniranja i Spašavanja u skriptama"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following log shows the login procedure of a fictitious <acronym>ISP</"
"acronym> that provides a new password on each login. The new password has to "
"be verified and recorded for the next session."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći odjeljak pokazuje postupak prijave fiktivnog <acronym>ISP</acronym> "
"koji daje novu lozinku za svaku prijavu. Nova lozinka mora biti verifikovana "
"i snimljena za narednu sesiju."

#. Tag: screen
#: dialog-setup.docbook:542
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"University of Lummerland\n"
" \n"
" Login:mylogin\n"
" Password: \n"
" The password for your next session is: YLeLfkZb\n"
" Please record and enter it for verification.\n"
" Verification:YLeLfkZb\n"
" \n"
" 1 = telnet\n"
" 2 = SLIP\n"
" 3 = PPP\n"
" \n"
" Your choice:"
msgstr ""
"University of Lummerland\n"
" \n"
" Login:mylogin\n"
" Password: \n"
" The password for your next session is: YLeLfkZb\n"
" Please record and enter it for verification.\n"
" Verification:YLeLfkZb\n"
" \n"
" 1 = telnet\n"
" 2 = SLIP\n"
" 3 = PPP\n"
