" Your choice:"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:544
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kppp; can be used to this cumbersome task for you, eliminating the risk of "
"losing that little sheet of paper that holds your current password at the "
"same time. The key part of the following script is the combination of Scan/"
"Save keywords."
msgstr ""
"&kppp; se može koristiti za ovaj vaš ogromni zadatak, eliminirajuči "
"istovremeno rizik od gubitka papira koji sadrži trenutnu lozinku. Ključni "
"dio sljedećih skripti je kombinacija Skeniraj/Spasi ključnih riječi."

