#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:557
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Execute tab"
msgstr "Izvršni tabular"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: dialog-setup.docbook:560
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Accounts <guilabel>Execute</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Računi <guilabel>Izvrši</guilabel> tabular</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: dialog-setup.docbook:566
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Accounts <guilabel>Execute</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Računi <guilabel>Izvrši</guilabel> tabular</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:568
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Accounts <guilabel>Execute</guilabel> tab</para>"
msgstr "<para>Računi <guilabel>Izvrši</guilabel> tabular</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:573
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can select commands to run at certain stages of the connection. "
"These commands are run with your real user id, so you cannot run any "
"commands here requiring root permissions, unless you are of course dialled "
"in as root (a bad thing to do for many reasons!)"
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete odabrati naredbe za pokretanje u određenim fazama spajanja. Ove "
"komande se pokreću sa vašim stvarnim korisničkim ID-om, tako da ne možete "
"pokrenuti bilo koje naredbe zahtijevajući root dozvole, osim ako, naravno "
"niste zvali kao root (loša stvar iz više razloga!)"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:578
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure to supply the whole path to the program, otherwise &kppp; may not "
"be able to find it."
msgstr ""
"Pobrinite se da popunite cijelu putanju do programa, inače &kppp; je možda "
"neće moći naći."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:581
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can add commands to be run at four distinct times during the connection "
"process:"
msgstr ""
"Možete dodati naredbe koje se pokreću na četiri različita načina tokom "
"procesa spajanja:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:586
#, no-c-format
msgid "Before Connect"
msgstr "Prije Spajanja"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:588
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Run this command before the dialing is initiated, so it is already running "
"when you connect to your <acronym>ISP</acronym>."
msgstr ""
"Pokrenite ovu naredbu prije nego što je pokrenuto biranje, tako da već radi "
"kada se povežete na vaš <acronym>ISP</acronym>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:593
#, no-c-format
msgid "Upon Connect"
msgstr "Poslije Spajanja"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:595
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run this command only after a successful connection is made."
msgstr "Pokrenite ovu komandu samo poslije uspješnog povezivanja."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:600
#, no-c-format
msgid "Before disconnect"
msgstr "Prije odspajanja"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:602
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run this command while still connected, before hanging up the modem."
msgstr "Pokrenite ovu komandu dok ste još spojeni, prije prekidanja modema."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: dialog-setup.docbook:607
#, no-c-format
msgid "Upon disconnect"
msgstr "Poslije odspajanja"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:609
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run this command after the connection has been closed."
msgstr "Pokrenite ovu komandu poslije prekidanja veze."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:614
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might for example want to run <application>leafnode</application> as "
"soon as you have connected, or check your mail. You might want to make sure "
"any mail in your queue is sent, before you close your connection down. You "
"might want a <quote>clean-up</quote> script to tidy up logs and clear your "
"cache after you have disconnected."
msgstr ""
"Možda na primjer želite pokrenuti <application>leafnode</application> čim se "
"spojite, ili provjeriti vašu poštu. Možda želite biti sigurni da je svaki "
"mail na čekanju poslat, prije nego što prekinete vezu. Možda želite  "
"<quote>Počistiti</quote> skriptu da bi pospremili unose i očistili vaš cache "
"nakon što ste se odspojili."

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:623
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Accounting tab"
msgstr "Tabular Računanja"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: dialog-setup.docbook:626
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>The Accounts <guilabel>Accounting</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Računi <guilabel>Računanje</guilabel> tabular</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: dialog-setup.docbook:632
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Accounts <guilabel>Accounting</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Računi <guilabel>Računanje</guilabel> tabular</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:634
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Accounts <guilabel>Accounting</guilabel> tab</para>"
msgstr "<para>Računi <guilabel>Računanje</guilabel> tabular</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:639
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check the <guilabel>Enable Accounting</guilabel> box to enable or disable "
"telephone cost accounting for this account."
msgstr ""
"Potvrdite <guilabel>Omogući Računanje</guilabel> okvir da omogućite ili "
"onemogućite računanje troškova telefona za ovaj račun."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:642
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select from the list the applicable rule for your telecoms provider."
msgstr "Izaberite iz liste važeće pravilo za vašeg pružatelja telekom usluga."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:645
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you can't find one, you can write one yourself by copying the supplied "
"template, which you will find in an <link linkend=\"appendix-accounting-"
"template\">appendix</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ako ne možete pronaći nijedno, sami možete napisati jedno kopiranjem "
"isporučenig šablona, kojeg ćete naći u <link linkend=\"appendix-accounting-"
"template\">appendix</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:649
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The final option on this page is <guilabel>Volume Accounting</guilabel>, "
"described below."
msgstr ""
"Zadnja opcija na ovoj stranici je <guilabel>Obim Računanja</guilabel>, "
"opisana ispod."

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:653
#, no-c-format
msgid "Volume Accounting"
msgstr "Obim Računanja"

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:656
#, no-c-format
msgid "What is volume accounting?"
msgstr "Šta je obim računanja?"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:658
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Basically, it means to count the number of bytes transmitted to and from the "
"Internet. &kppp; can count incoming bytes, outgoing bytes, or both. It's up "
"to you what you want (or must) use."
msgstr ""
"U osnovi, to znači da se broje bajtovi prenoseni prema i sa Interneta. "
"&kppp; može računati dolazne bajtove, odlazeće bajtove, ili oboje. Do vas je "
"da koristite ono što želite (ili morate)."

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:665
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why should I use volume accounting?"
msgstr "Zašto bih trebao koristiti obim računanja?"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:667
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many Internet Service Providers bill their customers based on the number of "
"bytes transferred. Even more commonly, <acronym>ISP</acronym>'s offer a flat "
"rate up to some arbitrary transfer limit, and then charge more for every "
"megabyte above this limit. &kppp; shows you your current volume and can help "
"you keep your bills to the minimum. Of course, even if you're not billed "
"based on volume, you can turn on volume accounting just to satisfy your own "
"curiosity."
msgstr ""
"Mnogi internet pružatelji usluga naplaćuju svojim kupcima na osnovu "
"prenesenog broja bajtova. Čak i češće, <acronym>ISP</acronym>'vi nude flat "
"osnovu do neke proizvoljne granice transfera, a zatim naplaćuju svaki "
"megabajta iznad ove granice. &kppp; vam pokazuje vaš trenutni obim i može "
"vam pomoći da zadržite vaše račune na minimumu. Naravno, čak i ako vam ne "
"naplaćuju na osnovu obima, možete uključiti obim računanja samo da "
"zadovoljite svoju radoznalost."

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:678
#, no-c-format
msgid "What type of volume accounting should I select?"
msgstr "Koju vrstu obima računanja da izaberem?"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:680
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"That depends mainly on your provider. Many of them only count how many "
"megabytes you download from the Internet, and ignore how much you send. In "
"that case you should choose <guilabel>Bytes In</guilabel>. If you have to "
"pay for both, you should choose <guilabel>Bytes In and Out</guilabel>. "
"<guilabel>Bytes Out</guilabel> is really only here for completeness, as "
"we're not aware of any providers using it as a billing basis. It might be "
"useful to those of you running a web or &FTP; server at home though."
msgstr ""
"Ovo uglavnom ovisi o vašem pružatelju usluga. Mnogi od njih računaju samo "
"koliko megabajta preuzmete sa interneta i ignorišu koliko šaljete. U tom "
"slučaju treba odabrati <guilabel>Bajti Unutra</guilabel>. Ako morate platiti "
"za oba, trebalo bi odabrati <guilabel>Bajti Unutra i Van</guilabel>. "
"<guilabel>Bajti Van</guilabel> je zapravo samo ovdje radi potpunosti, jer mi "
"ne znamo da ga bilo koji pružatelj usluga koristi kao osnovu za "
"naplaćivanje. Moglo bi biti korisno za one od vas koji koriste web ili &FTP; "
"server kod kuće."

#. Tag: title
#: dialog-setup.docbook:691
#, no-c-format
msgid "Drawbacks"
msgstr "Mane"

#. Tag: para
#: dialog-setup.docbook:693
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, there is a drawback on volume accounting. &kppp; will only "
"count the number of bytes, regardless of their origin. Many providers set "
"their limit only for Internet access, and not for data on their own network. "
"Some providers set different limits for data that is on their own network, "
"in the same country, and coming from overseas. So, if you're doing not much "
"websurfing, and getting most of your pages from your <acronym>ISP</"
"acronym>'s own proxy cache, then your provider is probably not charging you "
"for that data. &kppp; will not know these <acronym>IP</acronym> packets are "
"coming from the proxy, and so it will count them. So if you this situation "
"applies to you, or, as another example, your provider uses a caching news "
"server such as <application>nntpcached</application>, then the volume "
"reported by &kppp; may be higher than the amount you are going to be billed "
"for. On the bright side, at least &kppp; will never underestimate your bills."
msgstr ""
"Nažalost, postoji mana obima računanja. &kppp; će samo brojati broj bajtova, "
"bez obzira na njihovo porijeklo. Mnogi pružatelji usluga postavljaju svoje "
"granice samo za pristup internetu, a ne za podatke na vlastitoj mreži. Neki "
"pružatelji usluga postavljaju različite granice za podatke koji se nalaze na "
"njihovoj mreži, u istoj zemlji, i koji dolaze iz inostranstva. Dakle, ako "
"puno ne surfate mrežom, i dolazite do većine vaših stranica iz vašeg "
"<acronym>ISP</acronym> 'a vlastitog proxy cache-a, onda vam vaš pružatelj "
"usluga ne naplaćuje te podatke. &kppp; neće znati da ovi <acronym>IP</"
"acronym> paketi dolaze iz proxy-a, tako da će ih računati. Dakle, ako se ova "
"situacija odnosi na vas, ili, kao drugi primjer, vaš pružatelj usluga "
"koristi caching news server kao što je <application>nntpcached</"
"application>, onda obim prijavljen od &kppp; može biti veći od iznosa koji "
"će vam biti naplaćen. Sa vedrije strane, barem &kppp; nikada neće "
"podcijeniti vaše račune."
